sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Employee
    participant W as Web/PWA
    participant A as API / Case Workflow
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant O as Outbox Dispatcher
    participant Q as BullMQ
    participant R as AI Worker
    participant L as LLMProvider
    participant G as Goals + Progression

    U->>W: Submit completed AI case
    W->>A: POST command + idempotency key
    A->>D: TX: task/version + raw input + processing run + outbox
    D-->>A: Commit
    A-->>W: Accepted / processing_run_id
    O->>D: Read unpublished outbox
    O->>Q: Enqueue stable event/job id
    Q->>R: At-least-once delivery
    R->>D: Check run/message idempotency
    R->>L: Structured processing request
    L-->>R: Evidence / C-level / clarification
    alt clarification required
        R->>D: Persist waiting-for-clarification
        R-->>W: State available via API
    else final assessment
        R->>D: Begin finalization transaction
        R->>G: Deterministic score/goals/progression effects
        G-->>R: Validated effects
        R->>D: Assessment + ledgers + audit + outbox + processed-message
        D-->>R: Commit
    end
